      "content": "it's more than just being tired, kael. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end. the cycle of work, sleep, and trying to ignore the hunger or the cold... it's just a loop. sometimes i look at the ledge of the hab-blocks and i just think about how quiet it would be. no more sirens, no more systems. just stillness. does that even make sense?",
